@startuml SD-11_Explorer_RateAndFeedback

actor Explorer
actor "System Admin" as Adm
participant "Explorer app" as App
participant "Feedback" as Fb
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Rate occupation (FR-19) ==
Explorer -> App : Open rating form of an occupation
App -> Fb : Request form
Fb -> DB : Check full completion of the level
alt not fully completed
  Fb --> App : Refused
  App --> Explorer : Explain when the form opens
else completed
  Fb --> App : Five criteria
  Explorer -> App : Give scores and comment
  App -> Fb : Submit rating
  Fb -> DB : Store rating, one per explorer and occupation
  Fb --> App : Saved
end
Explorer -> App : View aggregated ratings
App -> Fb : Request aggregate
Fb -> DB : Count raters
alt below minimum population (NFR-06)
  Fb --> App : Withheld with reason
else enough raters
  Fb --> App : Aggregated scores
end

== App feedback (FR-20) ==
Explorer -> App : Send feedback
App -> Fb : Submit feedback
Fb -> DB : Store with time and app version
Fb --> App : Received
Adm -> Fb : Open review list
Fb -> DB : Load feedback
Fb --> Adm : List
@enduml
